Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:35.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll tell them t's part of the class. We'll say, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:39.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,that they're participating in a study of sleep disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are going to make history, Dwight...
