Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:55.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Each of you have been carefully selected to be in this class...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:13:01.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,for which you receive an automatic grade of "A" upon completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:06.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, this year's study is insomnia.
