Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,where we've established a controlled environment...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:15.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,in which we'll study your various sleep disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll be passing out directions...
