Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.44,0:41:17.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- and many more!  - Yo, I'm gonna buy that shit, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.11,0:41:20.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just $ 19.95...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I didn't mean to smoke your relatives! Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.73,0:41:36.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it by myself! Whitney and Bobby helped me! Please! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.18,0:41:40.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:43.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, shit, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.72,0:41:45.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.11,0:41:46.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:52.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aah! Oh, shit! I smell something burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.48,0:41:55.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.73,0:41:56.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.84,0:42:01.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, wait a second!  - Hold on, Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.40,0:42:04.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't rescue me yet. I'm getting high as a motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:09.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Toke, toke, toke, toke! Take it to the head! Take it to the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.24,0:42:10.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you take it like a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.69,0:42:15.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the Shorty down and I'll give you Funyons and Cheetos.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.71,0:42:20.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.03,0:42:21.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.07,0:42:23.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,This shit burns more than a perm!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.28,0:42:34.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a whole lot of freaky shit going on in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's more to this story than the Professor told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.04,0:42:40.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last night, I found a secret room...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.82,0:42:43.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I found all these newspaper clippings about Hugh Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.30,0:42:46.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a really evil man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.27,0:42:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I found a picture of his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.07,0:42:53.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! She looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:54.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:59.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have as many split ends and her skin's not as oily as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Yeah. Sometimes you do this little squinty thing with your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It looks like you got Down Syndrome or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.95,0:43:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, y'all look just alike except she got some perfect boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.07,0:43:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,and yours look like them old orangutan titties.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.60,0:43:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll put you in the full nelson and lick them. Ha ha h ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.42,0:43:22.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think she killed him and now he wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.73,0:43:28.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.74,0:43:46.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Morning, Dwight. Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:48.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help. I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:56.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Professor, uh, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.03,0:43:58.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you should consider cutting the experiment short. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:05.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,This poltergeist is growing increasingly more violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.74,0:44:08.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we're all in danger here and I've got to put my foot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.45,0:44:09.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,and stand up for what I believe in...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:12.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,and say that we've got to pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.28,0:44:15.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, Dwight. I say when we pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:19.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are on the verge of greatness...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:22.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I am this close to getting laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:25.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, the bus arrives on Monday. No one leaves till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.95,0:44:30.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here are the keys to the gate.No one gets access to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.28,0:44:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.78,0:44:36.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, I think the Professor's up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.78,0:44:38.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard Dwight tell the Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.30,0:44:39.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,there could be a poltergeist in the house...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.95,0:44:41.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,and that we could all be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.74,0:44:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, son! Not a poltergeist!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.61,0:44:46.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's a poltergeist?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.41,0:44:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.07,0:44:49.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. We can't go anywhere. The gates are locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.94,0:44:51.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dwight's the only one who has the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.03,0:44:52.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Baby, get my Vaseline.  - I'll handle...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.52,0:44:55.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get my Vaseline, a banana, and some duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.45,0:44:56.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.07,0:44:58.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fuck that little cripple up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.28,0:45:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, just give me five minutes alone with him.I'll get the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.94,0:45:11.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.99,0:45:14.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, Theo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.03,0:45:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.24,0:45:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, just a little experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.32,0:45:26.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. Work, work, work.Is that all you ever do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.67,0:45:30.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a lot riding on this project.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.82,0:45:36.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, the Professor might have everyone else fooled but
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.66,0:45:39.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know who the real brains behind this operation is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.24,0:45:42.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? You do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.70,0:45:46.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. That's what turns me on about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:52.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're so smart. And those sexy eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:46:01.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why don't I put some music on, huh?  - Yeah. Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:07.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Dwight...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.21,0:46:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear you're the only one who has the keys to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.57,0:46:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha. That's true. It is. I'm... Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.74,0:46:19.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.70,0:46:22.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to borrow those keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:27.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear sweet God in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.07,0:46:31.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I... yaaa, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.16,0:46:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, come on. Yes, you can, baby.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.83,0:46:34.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.63,0:46:38.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. You help me by giving me the keys...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.74,0:46:42.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'll help by giving you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.77,0:46:43.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, wait, wait! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.61,0:46:46.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't need your help, OK, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.74,0:46:49.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.86,0:46:55.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.86,0:46:57.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm tossing my own salad!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.11,0:47:15.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,So this is your secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.41,0:47:18.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:22.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,this just isn't gonna work now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.91,0:47:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.44,0:47:31.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.91,0:47:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,This way, you big hunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.91,0:47:45.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.24,0:47:48.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.99,0:47:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you playing a little game?Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.70,0:47:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.00,0:48:03.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.93,0:48:07.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is everybody here?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.18,0:48:08.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, shit, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.66,0:48:17.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna let us out of here! He's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:20.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, look. A rocket scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.53,0:48:22.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Quick. Everybody to the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.02,0:48:24.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move! Come on! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.41,0:48:26.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all are fucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.61,0:48:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.95,0:48:34.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- OK. We have to destroy it.  - That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.95,0:48:36.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna destroy what we can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:39.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got it! We'll shave off our pubic hairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.74,0:48:41.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,and wear the shampoo for two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.78,0:48:45.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Listen. Listen. We're gonna use these guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.74,0:48:48.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,They emit a bolt of concentrated energy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.91,0:48:52.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,which can damage the ectoplasmic cells and destroy the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.74,0:48:56.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no more ammunition. Conserve it. Use it wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.61,0:48:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.98,0:49:05.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey! Hey! Hey! Conserve your ammunition.  - My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.62,0:49:06.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Now, the only way...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.70,0:49:08.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,we're gonna be able to track these ghosts is
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.66,0:49:10.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,if we're all wearing one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.62,0:49:13.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,These are thermo goggles. They work on the principle of body heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.64,0:49:15.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're so powerful, they can detect...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.07,0:49:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,where any bodily fluids have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.78,0:49:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,even if they've been wiped clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.91,0:49:24.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.24,0:49:28.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are my glasses crooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:32.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now listen, that ghost may be invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.28,0:49:34.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,but we have the advantage of being armed...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.36,0:49:36.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,with the most sophisticated high-tech equipment known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.70,0:49:39.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we stay in touch with each other? Do we have some walkie-talkies?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.95,0:49:41.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. We have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.86,0:49:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Those is Dixie cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.16,0:49:51.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we kind of ran short of funds after the guns and the goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.99,0:49:55.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Now let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.74,0:49:57.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now wait a minute! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.78,0:49:59.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come every time some scary shit happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.24,0:50:00.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,that we need to stick together...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.74,0:50:02.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,you white people always say, "Let's split up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:04.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's right. We should stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.82,0:50:06.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! That's what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.16,0:50:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's right. OK. You three, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.20,0:50:18.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't that a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.32,0:50:25.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.67,0:50:35.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.95,0:50:36.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.07,0:50:39.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Where's Shorty?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.99,0:50:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.53,0:50:44.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.13,0:50:46.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.53,0:50:50.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:53.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. You wait right here. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.63,0:50:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- OK.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.51,0:51:06.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.11,0:51:08.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.28,0:51:13.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like the furnace room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.21,0:51:14.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right. Let's go.  - No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.71,0:51:18.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,In that newspaper article,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.02,0:51:19.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,it said that Hugh Kane was killed in the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:29.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. Look at this. There's so many ashes, Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.95,0:51:35.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?  - Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.30,0:51:45.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's split up. I'll meet you on the other end.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.91,0:51:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.61,0:51:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.66,0:52:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Shorty!  - Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.48,0:52:06.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a monster chasing me. What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.74,0:52:08.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I got it!  - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.27,0:52:14.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.77,0:52:16.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.20,0:52:26.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn. Why does the little bitch got to bring that shit over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.27,0:52:29.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Well, maybe she won't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.03,0:52:31.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me! Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.66,0:52:37.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit, she saw me. OK. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.80,0:52:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.20,0:52:49.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Now let that shit just, just mutilate her white ass and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.10,0:52:57.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn, bitch, please die!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.70,0:53:00.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Brenda! We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.66,0:53:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It would have just been you if you had just shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.80,0:53:04.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.86,0:53:05.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it a monster? Is it a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.91,0:53:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy? This is a skeleton. This is bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.74,0:53:21.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you run from Calista Flockhart?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.70,0:53:25.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut your ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.21,0:53:31.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. He crazy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.24,0:53:34.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr. Skeleton. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha! Gotcha! Psych!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.65,0:53:44.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, girl, I got an idea. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.77,0:53:48.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha ha. Very funny. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:55.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now get on out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.41,0:53:58.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody gonna catch an ass-whupping when I come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.30,0:54:00.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brenda, you are so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.62,0:54:02.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you really are my best friend, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.62,0:54:04.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.42,0:54:05.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.  - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It takes more than a little bag of bones to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.28,0:54:10.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wedgie!  - Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.18,0:54:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ghost has Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.66,0:54:14.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,My ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.53,0:54:17.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Brenda, do something!  - OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.53,0:54:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I was your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.95,0:54:25.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was. I'm gonna miss you, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.16,0:54:27.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.78,0:54:43.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.24,0:54:44.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, you're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.59,0:54:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. I think there's a first-aid kit in the lab. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.40,0:55:10.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Huey, baby, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.99,0:55:18.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,My love? Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.24,0:55:25.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Huey? Baby! Baby, I got to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. Go away!  - Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.86,0:55:29.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.74,0:55:32.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby. We can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.74,0:55:38.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, if we just stick together, no one can hurt us, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.91,0:55:41.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was just a booty call!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.03,0:55:48.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why won't you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.41,0:55:50.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you gave me crabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are the weakest link. Good-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.00,0:56:09.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. How you doing? Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.18,0:56:22.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no. No kissing. No kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.84,0:56:27.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Leave this on. Leave this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.69,0:56:30.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful just like that. Yeah. Yeah. Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:38.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:40.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't fuck it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.45,0:56:43.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about this whole friendship thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.95,0:56:46.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never had a friend who cared for me the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.09,0:56:47.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's Ray...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,but he cares for me in a different way...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.50,0:56:50.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,you know, like bringing me flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.95,0:56:53.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,and running my bath water.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.99,0:56:55.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,And there's nights when I wake up screaming,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.91,0:56:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I look over, and Ray's in my bed holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:04.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway seeing as how tonight may be our last night together...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.74,0:57:05.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.53,0:57:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,That we should take our friendship a little bit further.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.95,0:57:08.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes.  - Oh, Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.74,0:57:10.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.16,0:57:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,This might be our last night alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.99,0:57:16.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I want to take full advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.91,0:57:18.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:23.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I want to be able to act out our innermost fantasies.  - Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.20,0:57:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Like I've always wanted to walk on the moon.  - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.42,0:57:45.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about you, Buddy? What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.67,0:57:51.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's in here. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.07,0:58:10.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. He locked us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.28,0:58:12.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.24,0:58:16.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello! Hello. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.70,0:58:20.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in! Come in! Copy! Do you copy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.36,0:58:24.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a situation here! Breaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.99,0:58:28.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. They can't hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.47,0:58:30.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Must be these walls or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.81,0:58:39.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.41,0:58:43.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You stay down here. I'll go check upstairs.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:55.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you need help or...  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.07,0:58:56.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.03,0:58:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do I look like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.41,0:58:58.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just trying to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:58:59.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.44,0:59:01.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.95,0:59:03.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.95,0:59:06.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not literally. I'm serpentining!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.70,0:59:11.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,They taught me that Merchant marines. Two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.99,0:59:14.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Spent two years on my belly in Danang.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.91,0:59:19.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. Look. Look what the cripple's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.41,0:59:19.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.95,0:59:24.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you're proud. Just let me help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.11,0:59:27.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Step it back, candy pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.95,0:59:29.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.20,0:59:35.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are we gonna do? I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.01,0:59:38.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't feel my body, I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.10,0:59:39.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddy, can you feel this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.80,0:59:40.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.34,0:59:43.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try a little higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.14,0:59:43.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.74,0:59:46.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mm-mmm. Keep rubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.03,0:59:53.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Buddy, I don't think I'm re...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.44,0:59:56.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, please! It's a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.60,1:00:01.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you... in the name of love.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.45,1:00:08.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, Buddy. In the name of love.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.45,1:00:22.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cindy... I don't know how much longer I can hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.07,1:00:23.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you say your good-byes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.70,1:00:25.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.45,1:00:29.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you're gonna go on and you're gonna have lots of little babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.57,1:00:32.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And you're gonna die an old man.  - Old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.20,1:00:34.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Warm in his bed.  - Warm in his bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.20,1:00:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not here!  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.78,1:00:38.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not like this!  - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.59,1:00:39.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you understand me?  -  Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.32,1:00:43.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Coming to this house was the best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:44.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.59,1:00:48.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,And for that, I am so thankful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.45,1:00:51.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never! I'll never let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.45,1:00:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I feel weak.  - Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.91,1:00:55.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm com...  - Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.70,1:00:58.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Dwight Hartman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.20,1:01:04.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's your time to shine. All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.21,1:01:12.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.02,1:01:14.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.70,1:01:17.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. I don't even need my thermal goggles.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.02,1:01:45.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right, mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.36,1:01:58.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kane, you hungry? How about a little snack of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.66,1:02:14.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:27.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.69,1:02:31.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I fire 3 shots or 117?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.91,1:02:36.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, do you feel lucky, punk?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.74,1:02:40.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you... feel lucky? Do you feel lucky, punk?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:42.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoot me, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.48,1:02:51.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.24,1:02:53.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make your best move, ass bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.99,1:03:39.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:43.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.44,1:03:47.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. You're gonna fall unless you take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.61,1:03:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Give me your other hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.09,1:03:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. My other hand isn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You take my little hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.20,1:03:55.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Get it away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.07,1:03:57.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it! Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.78,1:04:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. Why me? No. Come on. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.91,1:04:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've served you well. Don't you do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.04,1:04:18.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, please. Please, no. Ple-ple-ple... Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.99,1:04:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, Buddy. It's time for us to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.45,1:04:59.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger. Roger. Come in, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.66,1:05:00.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, this is Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.70,1:05:02.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk to Cindy.I want to talk to Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.91,1:05:04.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger, where you at, man? Quit fucking around.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.99,1:05:08.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, listen. The ghost is close. He almost got us. Buddy's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:10.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's your location?  - I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.46,1:05:12.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, thank God. OK. Where's Shorty?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.99,1:05:16.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't... I don't know. He was here just a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.95,1:05:18.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, you go help Buddy in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.53,1:05:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll go check upstairs.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.13,1:05:25.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mmm. That smells good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.74,1:05:27.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.53,1:05:30.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say heloo to Cindy, Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.36,1:05:33.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heloo... Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.78,1:05:36.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty, are you OK? Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.50,1:05:41.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Morphine? Chloroform? Horse tranquilizers? You drugged him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.11,1:05:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did not. That's all his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.20,1:05:48.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Shorty. Who's ready for the main course?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.78,1:05:50.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me! Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.70,1:05:54.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hanson, please. No. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.61,1:05:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck?  - Beetlejuice in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.74,1:06:01.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is your brains on drugs. Hee!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.45,1:06:15.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.74,1:06:17.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.57,1:06:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.74,1:06:22.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Hanson. He's possessed. Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.41,1:07:04.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Angel style!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.52,1:09:16.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You OK, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.20,1:09:20.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I... I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.23,1:09:25.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aah! I can't feel my legs!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.24,1:09:26.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never could.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.32,1:09:28.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You stay out of this, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.24,1:09:32.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now listen. You get the others and meet us upstairs. All right?  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.32,1:09:36.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You stay here. Ray-Ray, I need your help. Give me your belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.38,1:09:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,The crane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.78,1:09:47.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,The crouching tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.86,1:09:54.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,The drunken monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:09:59.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,The mad cow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.66,1:10:04.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Motherfucker! Moo!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.95,1:10:08.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,The camel toe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.61,1:10:34.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of there, guys! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.28,1:10:42.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, give me a 180.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:46.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Listen. Someone has to go and lure him onto that platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.32,1:10:53.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.78,1:10:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cindy, let me...  - No, Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.04,1:10:57.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the one he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.19,1:11:03.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was saying... let me have your computer if you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.24,1:11:07.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- OK. But as soon as he gets there, you have to get off.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.95,1:11:09.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. 180 me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.16,1:11:14.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hugh Kane, it's me you want! Come get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.11,1:11:18.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid anymore! Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.41,1:11:41.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dwight, he's here. Do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.03,1:11:42.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't. She's still on the platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:44.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I throw the switch, she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.66,1:11:47.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, get out of there! You'll get killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.74,1:11:51.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move out of the way! I'll get her!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.11,1:11:55.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is he running so slow?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.41,1:11:57.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray! Run faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.95,1:11:59.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.45,1:12:01.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Throw the switch!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.41,1:12:03.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now you will be mine forever!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.74,1:12:19.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ray, you saved me. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I broke my fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.74,1:12:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, y'all. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.89,1:12:49.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shorty, you made it. You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.15,1:12:58.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was traumatic.It really was...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.74,1:13:01.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,and it's taking me a while to get over it, but, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.74,1:13:05.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,now that we're out of the house and back in school...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.74,1:13:08.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just know that everything's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.42,1:13:11.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, will you shut the fuck up?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.11,1:13:14.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you have just left me there to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.11,1:13:15.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a fucking rope. I'll hang myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.74,1:13:19.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here I go. I'm hanging myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Oh, hi, Dad. Are you having fun on your vacation?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.74,1:13:30.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Birds are very clean animals. He's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.91,1:13:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it! What the fuck did you put in this birdseed?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.07,1:13:42.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad, Buddy's here. I got to go. OK. I love you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.74,1:13:44.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, that was a big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.49,1:13:46.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.36,1:13:47.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise.Open chest!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.44,1:13:52.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! You got to be quicker than that, pencil dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.74,1:13:53.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.03,1:13:57.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out. A bee.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.95,1:14:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddy, I've never had anyone be so protective of me before.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.86,1:14:03.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what your man's supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.20,1:14:05.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.24,1:14:11.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddy, get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.59,1:14:13.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddy? Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.63,1:14:15.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:23.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is happening. Now we're gonna be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.07,1:14:25.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.32,1:14:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.70,1:14:34.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.16,1:14:37.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I didn't hear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,(鬼屋)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:33.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 莉莉不会离去  莉莉不会离去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 莉莉永不再离去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道这首吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:49.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这首才劲爆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 摇摇你的屁屁  小心点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:59.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我看看你动感的身躯 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:02.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 嫖客和皮条客 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 快来干活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:06.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我早警告过黑鬼 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 别想搞上我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:11.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 摇摇你的屁屁  小心点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:16.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我看看你动感的身躯 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有病
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫伊第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,她病了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,夭寿死囝仔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:08.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,一共是17块5毛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿  付钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:16.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是麦神父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我尽量加快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这把年纪还真不易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,先摸摸屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:27.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,会有帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了  我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:30.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,当你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,她好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 糟透了  神父  - 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不吃也不发一语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至不肯让我碰她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:52.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时你得拿糖果来诱拐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,神父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:57.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,教会派我协助你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是哈神父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,想见见那女孩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:07.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,等会  我要先为这房子祈福
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,死亡的悲伤指引我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:31.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我背负地狱的苦痛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我大声呼喊上主之名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,超脱我的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:58.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,神啊  请助我解除这恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:08.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝  仁慈万能的主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  麻辣锅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看到了吗  - 看看她  神父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救救这孩子  - 妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:48.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:22.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类的护卫者  请垂怜你的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚开  没用的老屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:28.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,全能的上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,小哈  你老妈也在这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,要留话吗  我会转告她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈  你能不能出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:43.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,待会见了  哈妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,全能的上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不朽的天父  耶苏的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,圣母玛丽的小孩的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:06:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,全能的上帝  不朽的天父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:05.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,您曾将暴君打入炼狱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:09.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,也曾派遣你儿子到尘世
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:13.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,也让作弊的人都被记大过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上我  上我  - 神父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:22.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,神父  没有人这样驱魔的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:28.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,以天父  基督之名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拿着  神父  - 滚吧  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的武器毫无作用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,住嘴  愿人都尊你的名
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 王国来临  - 闭嘴  你娘卡好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,《惊声尖笑2》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,(一年后)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子  你跟同学合得来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,算吧  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要用功点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要一个家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,却被老妈赶出门
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我在大学学到很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,书的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,卷烟纸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢大学吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:23.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有时会觉得我好逊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都很酷  我却很逊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  你也不赖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是需要点品味  加点料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,加料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,来  现在就让你变酷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先  别这样坐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,要酷一点  大胆一点  放松  展现自我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  接着这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这就是酷  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:59.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,站起来  我教你几招
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,右  左  右  左
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,右  左  右  踢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着嘴巴要说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:13.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,外套不错嘛  痞子  拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,外套不错嘛  痞子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拿来  - 拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:22.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这样  练一遍给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:25.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,右  左  右  踢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,外套不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我滚  贱货  拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,正点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:37.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好了没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:41.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,放心  我们不会迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,夹紧还是放开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哇靠  - 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:53.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们昨晚玩太疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨晚好棒  我真是爽呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:10:01.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喝了一桶啤酒  醒来发现我裸体躺在一桶冰旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇阿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:06.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  你被刺青了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠  刺了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠  你也被刺青了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:16.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的  刺了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:17.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  搞我吧  小雷  搞我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  搞我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:32.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,来点刺激的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  别害我终身不举
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你外套真炫  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:43.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天有人被攻击  还被抢了外套
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:45.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是有人这么野蛮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,下节课是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:48.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,心理学
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是  101室吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 十点在302室  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:56.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是的  我的第六感超强
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:02.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天记得提醒我去签六合彩  别分开走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:05.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,第六感告诉我会带衰的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是真信那些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我信  我超信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:14.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,(横行霸道请打投诉专线)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,(鬼屋计划)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些都是参加者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的  最上面这些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,都有濒死经验
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,有辣妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你很清楚  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,有濒死经验的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:31.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,很适合用来做超自然调查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:36.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我特别考虑他们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:38.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好  歪头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:41.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,受过伤的女学生最好搞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的  她是辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:50.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,典型的被遗弃型人格失序
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,她有防卫心  但很合作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是小雷  我搞不清楚他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:12:00.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过他见我时似乎很热情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,面谈后他寄给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:13.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们都是史郡屠杀案的生还者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:17.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:21.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些孩子就是最好的媒介
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:25.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以唤醒鬼屋的恶灵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,要如何骗他们过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,就说这是课程的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:39.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要参与睡眠失调的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要成名了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一篇有力的文献
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:48.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,窥探死后的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位好  我是欧教授
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:55.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位经过仔细的挑选
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:13:01.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,将会自动获得优等成绩  只要完成研究
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:06.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,今年的研究主题是失眠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:09.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要一起渡过一个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,在受控制的环境下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:15.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起研究各位的睡眠失调症
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会发给各位说明书
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以发  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:21.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我自己就能发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位今晚六点要准时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,要待到周一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的书掉了  哈痢破特  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是巴迪  - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来我们要共度周末了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,要一起K书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:53.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,K书
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:59.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  巴迪  你人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我刚结束一段恋情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还没准备好要再约会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:09.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们能当朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:13.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  酷啊  当朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 回头见了  朋友  - 好的  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,大内裤  回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:27.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们活着  我们记得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:35.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾共度美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:41.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,随着时光转变  无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:45.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴  让我唱歌好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:44.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:00.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,小家伙  你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,小  我才不小  我可大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,看过小鸟有如此巨根吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大吃一惊吧  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:12.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,有需要再来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:26.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:41.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  孩子  我吓坏你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:45.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  你吓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:52.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  我唱歌给你听  上帝在她神圣的殿堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:16:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:02.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是欧教授的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是管家韩森
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:11.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我叫辛蒂  - 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,长的真像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:18.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,一样的削瘦双颊和双唇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,一样的眼睛  还有你的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:31.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有一样的鼻子  呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:37.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带你去房间吧好重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该用强壮的手来提
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇  好多内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:46.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的东西好多喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了牙刷  晚上要用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后会用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:59.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,走  跟我来  跟着我的屁屁走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:00.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,往这边  到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:09.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一个人住这
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,对  我们想过要出租
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:14.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,但好像没人敢住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是老夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是老先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:21.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:25.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是凯子主人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:27.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它真可爱  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:30.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是凯子主人最喜欢的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不知它怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:37.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些玩具有时好像是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:53.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  不是那间  小亲亲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:56.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是主人情妇的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:19:00.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很色的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:03.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你住这间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他挚爱的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的夫人  卡洛琳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带你看  借我屁屁过一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心  屁屁要过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,真美
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:23.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  我都有做运动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:25.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我天天都做提臀运动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我用力缩紧  再放松
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:33.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,用力缩紧  再放松
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡洛琳穿上那件可美呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:46.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实  她一直是美若天仙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:49.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,她曾承欢皇室贵族
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:51.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,和平民百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:54.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至还有美国总统
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:04.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别怕  这是猫老大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,它是主人最喜欢的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,它历经家族数代传承
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看它  还是像只小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:16.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  我想我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,有任何需要直接来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.79,0:20:22.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授  我已搞定一切
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:26.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括急救箱跟血浆  以防意外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.79,0:20:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些监视器遍及各个角落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:31.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的  我想这样最好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:35.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以要是小妞去洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我该按哪个钮好看特写  - 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:46.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的客人已陆续抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:51.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚餐马上就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:53.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了  掌厨的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:56.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是管家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:21:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是直排轮鞋吧  走路小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,可别跌倒打破东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:08.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好笑  拍拍手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真好心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,干脆起立鼓掌算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来扶我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  我知道你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:19.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好面熟  跳过八家将吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:20.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:26.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  我要走了  走了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:29.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要去准备晚餐  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:30.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,等会见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好  我会立刻上楼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,换上慢跑装后立刻下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:41.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,小家伙  你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:43.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚开  四眼田鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:45.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫你滚开  四眼田鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:53.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真欠揍  - 嗨  嗨  嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样  那只是一只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,小鸟  要不要吃　干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃你老妈的屁屁啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:04.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,小鸟说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:08.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说  小鸟要吃你老妈的屁屁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能这样叫我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又不认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识  我昨晚才玩过她
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,想干架吗  你找死
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,好可怕  我好害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的  我得文明一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:23.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来  拿好我的牙  - 来啊  爆炸头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:24.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,想跟我干架来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.97,0:22:26.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有种就来打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的核心吗  给我一些
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:29.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有种就来啊  - 不  不  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:31.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有种别只是讲  有种做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊  混蛋  放我出去  海扁你一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家好  - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:40.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨  巴迪  - 嗨  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:42.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你最近好吗  - 胸前有空档
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你反应要快一点  A罩杯女
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:47.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔  喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家好  - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:50.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最近好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.71,0:22:54.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们打算继续发呆流口水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:22:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是帮我弄个座位
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我帮你暖好了  这是最棒的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授  这间房子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:14.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是曾有个小女孩被恶魔附身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:17.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,是有这种报导  但未证实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:27.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁要吃开胃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:31.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我真高兴听到这些  - 这些面包看着真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:34.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  又软又暖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:36.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小雷  - 抱歉  我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:38.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.13,0:23:42.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢  我亲手做的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想洋芋泥快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.92,0:23:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,只需要再搅拌一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:03.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  该切火鸡了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 粉嫩粉香的火鸡  - 不  不
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.44,0:24:14.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:17.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 让小手休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.02,0:24:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很乐意  不过你真好心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:26.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我捏捏你的小脸  - 噢  不
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.09,0:24:30.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多人很怕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.45,0:24:34.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,料理火鸡  其实很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只要了解它的生理构造
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:40.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有个小小的屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:44.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,但它足以让你的手塞进去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:50.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,把里面塞紧  我都把内脏一起煮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,连蛋蛋也不放过
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人会在上面涂油  但我这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.75,0:25:00.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我用力舔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:03.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着舔进它的小屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,那没什么用  我不知它有啥用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我还是舔  上下舔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着我对着它冲刺
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:20.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着我再拔根毛放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,就更美味了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,等到我觉得差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:27.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,就把它拿来餐桌旁
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.56,0:25:30.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,真香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.59,0:25:34.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  谁要吃鸡翅
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.21,0:25:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃你的还是火鸡的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.04,0:25:45.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你要吃什么  腿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:47.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,来两腿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.75,0:25:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我拿那两只腿插你屁眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,插给你死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.50,0:25:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,歪头  冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.71,0:25:55.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,韩森  请问你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:26:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,菜单上有没有  不是你亲手准备的餐点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.65,0:26:05.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我叫了外卖甜点  - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:08.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好  派来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.79,0:26:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁要吃第一片
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.39,0:26:17.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到你的眼神了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.59,0:26:20.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.59,0:26:22.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,传给她
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:23.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.81,0:26:25.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.42,0:26:28.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:30.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:33.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.43,0:26:49.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.75,0:28:17.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.75,0:28:21.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.50,0:28:23.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想帮你  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.13,0:28:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:28.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有危险  我想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.13,0:28:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么帮我  谁有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.13,0:28:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,去琴房看看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:35.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:37.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,去那个烂琴房看看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:44.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂  反应快点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:46.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真逊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.96,0:28:52.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪  关于做朋友的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:54.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得能有女的朋友很酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.96,0:28:58.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错  我是女的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.92,0:29:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能对我这么粗暴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.34,0:29:01.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.82,0:29:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,温柔一点的事  像聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.79,0:29:10.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,分享秘密和过去的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.71,0:29:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这些嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.71,0:29:14.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,真像是搞同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.75,0:29:16.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你是女的  应该还好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:19.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  很好吗  - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:23.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不要跟我去察看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.09,0:29:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.17,0:29:26.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.56,0:29:28.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我高中的事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.14,0:29:29.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.71,0:29:31.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,很呛的  和西班牙妞胡搞
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.79,0:29:34.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 这里最精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:36.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是  有人忘了垫卫生棉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:42.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,它往书架那边走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.75,0:30:00.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是个秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.21,0:30:22.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,(凯阿修与情妇被谋杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面说凯阿修跟情妇在屋内遇害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.04,0:30:27.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.75,0:30:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一定是他太太
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:34.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇咧  她长的跟你好像
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.34,0:30:35.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的这么想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.01,0:30:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她真的好美  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.13,0:30:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你头发的分叉比她多
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.29,0:30:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的脸比较油
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.65,0:30:46.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,眼睛比较小
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.46,0:30:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看来像是得了唐氏症
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.79,0:30:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 其他部份就很像了  - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.71,0:30:53.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有  她的奶子比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,不像你的那么可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.79,0:30:59.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太外扩了  - 好了  够了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:02.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:04.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:10.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡洛琳  这一定是她的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.72,0:31:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.75,0:31:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走吧  这里令人发毛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.29,0:31:18.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧  帮忙捧一下  - 谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴迪  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.20,0:31:22.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是指箱子  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇咧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.79,0:32:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,(星期三)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.92,0:32:12.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,(今天星期五)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.25,0:32:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  早知道我就会先洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:39.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望你有先洗澡  上去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.96,0:32:41.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是你想要的  - 是的  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.38,0:32:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了  爸爸  尽情狂欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.96,0:32:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准跑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.71,0:32:53.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  我的外号叫种猪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.96,0:32:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我最棒的经验了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.84,0:33:00.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯太太  听起来不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.82,0:33:06.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝  你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.21,0:33:09.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,再联络哦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.17,0:33:18.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,来点特别的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.75,0:33:21.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.50,0:33:23.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.88,0:33:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,说点龌龊的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.50,0:33:28.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.17,0:33:30.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.96,0:33:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  你让我变得好坏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.25,0:33:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个坏女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.86,0:33:39.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.46,0:33:44.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要令你硬挺  - 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.75,0:33:46.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要占有它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.34,0:33:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都是你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.63,0:33:50.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要尿在你脸上
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.50,0:33:52.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你嘴里放屁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.17,0:33:54.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,对  还要做蛋糕泄愤
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.92,0:33:56.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.95,0:33:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,太龌龊了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.62,0:34:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.75,0:34:14.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪  你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.89,0:34:29.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.29,0:34:37.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你为何这么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.71,0:34:40.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是故意在你砂盆里大便
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:50.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命  猫老大发飙了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.34,0:35:21.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想干架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.99,0:35:27.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道厉害了吧  贱猫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.38,0:35:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.09,0:35:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就只会这两下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,来点真本事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:58.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉你  它被附身了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:36:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,辣妹  你有看到它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.96,0:36:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有  我听到打斗声
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.09,0:36:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我到的时候它已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.17,0:36:10.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这总不会是我自己弄的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.75,0:36:12.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.45,0:36:15.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,猫很有领域观念
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,它是有可能攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.79,0:36:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,但那并不代表它被附身
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.96,0:36:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你们俩该睡一起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这话什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:31.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想万一它再来攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.34,0:36:34.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,它应该不会攻击你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.71,0:36:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,性灵合体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.46,0:36:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  这是学术
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.79,0:36:42.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩这是做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.96,0:36:45.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想他是帮不上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.75,0:36:46.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很乐意搓合你们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.63,0:36:50.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧  我送你去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.67,0:36:55.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好  别忘了互吻道晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.92,0:36:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这屋内有鬼  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我头壳没坏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.62,0:37:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,一  二  三  四  五  六  七
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.71,0:37:15.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,八  九  十  十一  来吧  跟我一起数
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.59,0:37:36.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿  你好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.86,0:37:41.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,进来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.96,0:37:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.13,0:37:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.92,0:37:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,想玩吗  来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.50,0:37:58.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这游戏很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.17,0:38:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷叔叔有别的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.71,0:38:03.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,把你的手指拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.55,0:38:04.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,胳肢  胳肢  胳肢  胳肢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:11.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我嘿咻嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.09,0:38:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.36,0:38:16.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.79,0:38:19.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,送你一个小汽球
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.71,0:38:28.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,(日记)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.96,0:38:33.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我无法再跟他共处
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.25,0:38:35.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,他成了一个怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.92,0:38:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怀疑他在搞婚外情
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:41.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他跟保母小薇有一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.29,0:38:43.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他才雇她
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:45.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们根本没小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂  我要你知道我的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:00.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.17,0:39:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.42,0:39:13.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不生我的气了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.42,0:39:15.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会呢  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.79,0:39:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你放轻松点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.06,0:39:37.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,她好像起疑心了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:39.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:42.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你老婆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.56,0:39:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天啊  就是在这里发生的  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.48,0:39:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,她回到家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.90,0:39:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.90,0:39:54.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到谁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:56.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来在她房里看她的日记
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.06,0:39:59.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着我在柜子里找到这件衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.35,0:40:02.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只记得这么多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.06,0:40:04.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你呢  小雷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来找吃的  洋装是周五买的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.52,0:40:09.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,够美吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:12.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安  小树苗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.48,0:40:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝光水水
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.85,0:40:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,长成又高又壮的大麻树
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.40,0:40:24.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就能把你卷起来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.06,0:40:26.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后毁了你的前途
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.87,0:40:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.69,0:40:31.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.65,0:40:41.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,(牙仙子)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.02,0:40:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我今晚要抢牙仙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.44,0:40:56.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,霉龟唱片推出嘻哈圣诞专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.23,0:41:00.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,收录经典  圣诞公公跟我老母
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:03.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真是太爽了  - 我正梦到一个白人女人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.65,0:41:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有  雪人怎么不贱了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.81,0:41:09.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,圣诞叫床声  淫色圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:13.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要在牢里过圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.42,0:41:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,一路爽叮当
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.44,0:41:17.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有很多好听的酷歌  - 我要买这张
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.11,0:41:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要19块95
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是有意抽你亲戚的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.73,0:41:36.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是惠妮跟巴比布朗教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.18,0:41:40.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:43.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.72,0:41:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  靠
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.11,0:41:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:52.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,有东西烧焦了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.48,0:41:55.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠  就是我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.73,0:41:56.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.84,0:42:01.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等一等  - 撑着点  矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.40,0:42:04.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,先别救我  这样满high的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,抽吧  用力抽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.24,0:42:10.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你象个婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.69,0:42:15.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,把矮子放下  我就给你洋芋片
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.71,0:42:20.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.03,0:42:21.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.07,0:42:23.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意烧的比烫头发还快
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.28,0:42:34.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这屋子有鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授没有说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.04,0:42:40.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我昨晚发现一个密室
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.82,0:42:43.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到这些跟凯阿修有关的剪报
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.30,0:42:46.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.27,0:42:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还找到一张他老婆的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.07,0:42:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇靠  她跟你好像
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:54.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:59.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你头发的分叉比她多  你的脸比较油
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  还有你的眼睛小
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来像是得了唐氏症
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.95,0:43:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真的很像  但她奶子较大
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.07,0:43:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的像红毛猩猩一样瘪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.60,0:43:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,要后仰才能露出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.42,0:43:22.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  够了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想是她杀了他  而他想找我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.73,0:43:28.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  贱货
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.74,0:43:46.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,早安  歪头  我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要帮忙  我可以自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:56.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授  我们需要谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.03,0:43:58.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你该考虑中断实验
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:05.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,屋里的鬼越来越残暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.74,0:44:08.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有危险  我得脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.45,0:44:09.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,站出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:12.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,阻止这场实验
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.28,0:44:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,歪头  这得由我来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:19.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就快成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:22.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也快搞上辣妹了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:25.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,礼拜一前  谁也不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.95,0:44:30.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是大门的钥匙  不准任何人走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.28,0:44:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  教授
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.78,0:44:36.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位  我想教授别有阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.78,0:44:38.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听到歪头说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.30,0:44:39.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这屋内有恶鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.95,0:44:41.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可能都有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.74,0:44:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会吧  不要恶鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.61,0:44:46.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么是饿鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.41,0:44:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.07,0:44:49.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行  大门锁起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.94,0:44:51.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有歪头有钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.03,0:44:52.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拿凡士林来  - 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.52,0:44:55.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿凡士林  香蕉跟胶带来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.45,0:44:56.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要打断他的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.07,0:44:58.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他阿鲁巴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.28,0:45:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我五分钟  我可以拿到钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.94,0:45:11.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  歪头
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.99,0:45:14.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.03,0:45:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.24,0:45:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是个小实验
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.32,0:45:26.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,工作  工作  怎么老是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.67,0:45:30.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个计划有很多变数
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.82,0:45:36.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授把大家耍的团团转
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.66,0:45:39.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我知道谁才是真正的天才
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.24,0:45:42.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.70,0:45:46.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对你着迷不已
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:52.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好聪明  眼睛又性感
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:46:01.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放点音乐吧  - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:07.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,歪头
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.21,0:46:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说你有大门钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.57,0:46:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.74,0:46:19.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.70,0:46:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想借钥匙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:27.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.07,0:46:31.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.16,0:46:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你可以的  宝贝  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.83,0:46:34.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.63,0:46:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把钥匙给我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.74,0:46:42.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.77,0:46:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.61,0:46:46.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.74,0:46:49.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.86,0:46:55.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.86,0:46:57.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我折腾自己的沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.11,0:47:15.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来这就是你的密室
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.41,0:47:18.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:22.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样下去不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.91,0:47:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.44,0:47:31.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.91,0:47:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边  大帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.91,0:47:45.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们见过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.24,0:47:48.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,来  等你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.99,0:47:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了  你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.70,0:47:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.00,0:48:03.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.93,0:48:07.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家都到了吗  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.18,0:48:08.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.66,0:48:17.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不会让我们走  他要杀我们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快看  有丑女
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.53,0:48:22.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家快点  到实验室去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.02,0:48:24.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,走 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.41,0:48:26.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.61,0:48:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,锁门
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.95,0:48:34.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们得摧毁它  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.95,0:48:36.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们又看不见它  怎么摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:39.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了  我们把毛剃光
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.74,0:48:41.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,再涂上头虱药
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.78,0:48:45.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  我们要用这些枪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.74,0:48:48.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们能放射能源弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.91,0:48:52.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,破坏灵体  摧毁鬼魂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.74,0:48:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹药有限  别乱开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.61,0:48:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.98,0:49:05.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 节约弹药  - 我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.62,0:49:06.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.70,0:49:08.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一能搜寻
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.66,0:49:10.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,鬼魂的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.62,0:49:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是戴上这些感热护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.64,0:49:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,它能感测体温  功能强大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.07,0:49:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至能测得残留体液
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.78,0:49:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,纵使你早已擦干净
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.91,0:49:24.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.24,0:49:28.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:32.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  鬼也许无形
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.28,0:49:34.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们有高科技武器
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.36,0:49:36.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,能用来对付它
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.70,0:49:39.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么联系  有对讲机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.95,0:49:41.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,用这些
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.86,0:49:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是纸杯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.16,0:49:51.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,护目镜跟能源枪花光了经费
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.99,0:49:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  我们分开行动
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.74,0:49:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.78,0:49:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么每次发生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.24,0:50:00.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么恐怖的事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.74,0:50:02.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们白人就爱叫人散开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:04.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,她说的对  团结就是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.82,0:50:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.16,0:50:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  你们三个  跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.20,0:50:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇咧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.32,0:50:25.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.67,0:50:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.95,0:50:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.07,0:50:39.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.99,0:50:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道  矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.53,0:50:44.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.13,0:50:46.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.53,0:50:50.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:53.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这等着  我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.63,0:50:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.51,0:51:06.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是干嘛的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.11,0:51:08.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.28,0:51:13.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概是暖炉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.21,0:51:14.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走吧  - 不  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.71,0:51:18.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,剪报上写凯阿修就是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.02,0:51:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在暖炉遇害
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:29.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看  好多灰
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.99,0:51:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,(大选变天)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.95,0:51:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛  - 慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.30,0:51:45.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们散开  到那端会合  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.91,0:51:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.61,0:51:51.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.45,0:51:56.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(杀她)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.66,0:52:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 矮子  - 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.48,0:52:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,有怪物追我  我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.74,0:52:08.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有了  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.27,0:52:14.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.77,0:52:16.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.20,0:52:26.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠  那贱货干嘛把它引到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.27,0:52:29.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许她不会看到我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.03,0:52:31.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊  小兰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.66,0:52:37.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的  她看到我了  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.80,0:52:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.20,0:52:49.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,让那怪物把她大卸八块吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.10,0:52:57.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的  快死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.70,0:53:00.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  小兰  我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.66,0:53:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是你乱叫拖我下水
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.80,0:53:04.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.86,0:53:05.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,它是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,它是怪物吗  它是怪物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.91,0:53:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,这只是骷髅  骨头罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.74,0:53:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,得了厌食症的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.70,0:53:25.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.21,0:53:31.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,它发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.24,0:53:34.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,骷髅先生  在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈  上当了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.65,0:53:44.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个主意  过来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.77,0:53:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:55.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我滚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.41,0:53:58.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我回来就有人要倒大霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.30,0:54:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,小兰  你好勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.62,0:54:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.62,0:54:04.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.42,0:54:05.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没事  - 当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,它根本吓不倒我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.28,0:54:10.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大内裤  - 啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.18,0:54:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,鬼抓了巴迪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.66,0:54:14.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的屁屁
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.53,0:54:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想想办法  小兰  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.53,0:54:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为我是你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.95,0:54:25.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是过去式了  我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.16,0:54:27.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.78,0:54:43.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.24,0:54:44.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你流血了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.59,0:54:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,来  实验室有急救箱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.40,0:55:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝小阿修  你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.99,0:55:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱人  你在那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.24,0:55:25.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,小阿修  我要跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  滚开  - 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.86,0:55:29.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,别来烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.74,0:55:32.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,来嘛  宝贝  我们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.74,0:55:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,相爱相守  谁能伤害我们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.91,0:55:41.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只是一夜情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.03,0:55:48.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不跟我谈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.41,0:55:50.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你给我螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真没用  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.00,0:56:09.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.18,0:56:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不亲嘴  不亲嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.84,0:56:27.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,戴着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.69,0:56:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就美呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:38.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:40.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,别毁了这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.45,0:56:43.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我仔细思考我们之间的友谊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.95,0:56:46.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,从未有朋友这么关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.09,0:56:47.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷也关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,但那不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.50,0:56:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他送花给我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.95,0:56:53.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我放洗澡水
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.99,0:56:55.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我夜里被恶梦惊醒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.91,0:56:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷会在床上搂着我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:04.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,总之  今晚也许是最后一夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.74,0:57:05.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.53,0:57:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该更深入交往
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.95,0:57:08.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 噢  巴迪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.74,0:57:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.16,0:57:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可能是我们的最后一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.99,0:57:16.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想享受一切
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.91,0:57:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要满足我们最深切的幻想  - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.20,0:57:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 像我一直都想到月球上漫步  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.42,0:57:45.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你呢  你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.67,0:57:51.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,鬼来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.07,0:58:10.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  他把我们锁起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.28,0:58:12.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该找人援助
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.24,0:58:16.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼叫  有人听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.70,0:58:20.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,请说  有人听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.36,0:58:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有状况  呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.99,0:58:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.47,0:58:30.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该是墙隔住了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.81,0:58:39.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.41,0:58:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你待在这  我上楼去看看  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:55.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 需要帮忙吗  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.07,0:58:56.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.03,0:58:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.41,0:58:58.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,表示友好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:58:59.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.44,0:59:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.95,0:59:03.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.95,0:59:06.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,用火力掩护  我这是S形前进
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.70,0:59:11.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我当佣兵两年学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.99,0:59:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在越南匍匐前进了两年  - 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.91,0:59:19.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇  看那个残废在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.41,0:59:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇靠
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.95,0:59:24.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我了解你的自尊  让我帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.11,0:59:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后  臭娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.95,0:59:29.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.20,0:59:35.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办  我好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.01,0:59:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我失去知觉了  好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.10,0:59:39.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.80,0:59:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.34,0:59:43.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,没  再上面一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.14,0:59:43.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.74,0:59:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续摩擦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.03,0:59:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  我没准
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.44,0:59:56.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是生离死别的关头
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.60,1:00:01.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以爱为名请求你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.45,1:00:08.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  巴迪  一切为爱
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.45,1:00:22.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂  我快撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.07,1:00:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许你就这样走掉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.70,1:00:25.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定能出去的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.45,1:00:29.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以后也会子孙满堂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.57,1:00:32.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你也必将安享天年  - 安享天年
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.20,1:00:34.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在家寿终  - 在家寿终
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.20,1:00:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是在这  - 不是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.78,1:00:38.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是这样  - 一个男人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.59,1:00:39.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你懂吗  - 噢  我懂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.32,1:00:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,被关在此是我此生最美好的事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:44.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.59,1:00:48.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此  我心存感激
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.45,1:00:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我永不放手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.45,1:00:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我好虚弱  - 巴迪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.91,1:00:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要去了  - 回过神来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.70,1:00:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  歪头
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.20,1:01:04.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,该你上场表现了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.21,1:01:12.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  姓凯的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.02,1:01:14.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,出来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.70,1:01:17.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要什么感热护目镜
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.02,1:01:45.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.36,1:01:58.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,姓凯的  饿吗  该吃点心了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.66,1:02:14.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:27.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.69,1:02:31.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我弹药够吗还是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.91,1:02:36.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得你运气够好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.74,1:02:40.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己够走运吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:42.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,开枪吧  猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.48,1:02:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.24,1:02:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,动手吧  废人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.61,1:03:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,(风火轮)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.99,1:03:39.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命  救命
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:43.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,来  抓住我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.44,1:03:47.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,再不抓你就会掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.61,1:03:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  伸出你另一支手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.09,1:03:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,另一支手没力
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓我的小手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.20,1:03:55.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  别碰我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.07,1:03:57.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,快  抓住我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.78,1:04:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  为何找上我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.91,1:04:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忠心耿耿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.04,1:04:18.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这么对我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.99,1:04:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪  我们该离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.45,1:04:59.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到  请说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.66,1:05:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.70,1:05:02.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要你  我要找罗杰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.91,1:05:04.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰  你在哪  别再混了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.99,1:05:08.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  恶鬼怪发飙  巴迪受伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:10.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里  - 就在你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.46,1:05:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝  矮子呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.99,1:05:16.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知  他刚才还在的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.95,1:05:18.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  你去帮巴迪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.53,1:05:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我去楼上看看  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.13,1:05:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,真香
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.74,1:05:27.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.53,1:05:30.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子  跟辛蒂打招呼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.36,1:05:33.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.78,1:05:36.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧  说话啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.50,1:05:41.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,吗啡  摇头丸  你对他下药
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.11,1:05:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有  那都是他的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.20,1:05:48.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  矮子  谁要吃大餐
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.78,1:05:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我  我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.70,1:05:54.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,韩森  不要
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.61,1:05:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 搞屁啊  - 吸毒的小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.74,1:06:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,脑子就长这样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.45,1:06:15.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.74,1:06:17.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是酷毙了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.57,1:06:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.74,1:06:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,韩森被附身了  快阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.41,1:07:04.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,娇娃出动
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.52,1:09:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.20,1:09:20.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脚失去知觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.23,1:09:25.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉不到我的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.24,1:09:26.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,废话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.32,1:09:28.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.24,1:09:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 通知大家到楼上会合  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.32,1:09:36.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷你留下  皮带给我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.38,1:09:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,鹤形拳
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.78,1:09:47.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,卧虎拳
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.86,1:09:54.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,醉猴拳
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:09:59.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,狂牛拳
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.66,1:10:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,有胆来啊  哞
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.95,1:10:08.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,骆驼腿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.61,1:10:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走吧  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.28,1:10:42.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,向后转
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:46.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,好  得有人到平台上诱他上钩
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.32,1:10:53.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.78,1:10:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂  让我  - 不  巴迪
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.04,1:10:57.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要的是我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.19,1:11:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是想万一你死了  电脑给我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.24,1:11:07.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他一上去你就赶快下来  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.95,1:11:09.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,向后转
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.16,1:11:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯阿修  你要的是我  来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.11,1:11:18.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不怕了  出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.41,1:11:41.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,歪头  快动手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.03,1:11:42.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行  她还在上面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:44.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我打开开关  她会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.66,1:11:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛蒂  快走  你会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.74,1:11:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开  我去救她
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.11,1:11:55.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他怎么跑这么慢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.41,1:11:57.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.95,1:11:59.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.45,1:12:01.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开开关
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.41,1:12:03.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我的了  永远
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.74,1:12:19.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小雷  你救了我  你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事  后面有垫背的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.74,1:12:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.89,1:12:49.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,矮子  你没死  我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.78,1:12:54.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(二个月后)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.15,1:12:58.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那真是一场惊魂记
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.74,1:13:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得花点时间复原
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.74,1:13:05.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已出来  重返学校
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.74,1:13:08.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道一切都会好转
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.42,1:13:11.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  闭上你的鸟嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.11,1:13:14.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不让我死了算了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.11,1:13:15.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我绳子  我要上吊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.74,1:13:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  我上吊了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸  你玩得愉快吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.74,1:13:30.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  鸟很爱干净的  没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.91,1:13:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇靠  你在鸟食里放了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.07,1:13:42.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪来了  我要挂了  拜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.74,1:13:44.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇  好大一摊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.49,1:13:46.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.36,1:13:47.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,惊喜  胸前有空档
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.44,1:13:52.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得快点  小根男
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.74,1:13:53.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.03,1:13:57.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心蜜蜂
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.95,1:14:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是这世上最保护我的人了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.86,1:14:03.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,做你的男人就该这样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.20,1:14:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,两根热狗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.24,1:14:11.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪  抓住他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.59,1:14:13.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴迪  巴迪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.63,1:14:15.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我回来找你了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:23.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错  我们将厮守终身了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.07,1:14:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.32,1:14:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.70,1:14:34.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听见了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.16,1:14:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不  我什么也没听见
